                <divLine xml:id="m-235bfc7e-54ea-4746-b5cc-f53fd7fcd3cd" facs="#m-50ccb625-fd32-4b25-b341-c4c7ed9be95e" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-c3897fcf-07ff-4071-abfa-49ec27b68ec9">
              <lg xml:id="m-2b3cc476-c582-42e7-94b9-ec5da9879abe">
                <l xml:id="m-487ad302-adf9-42bd-8b40-69d4e731126e" facs="#m-1ea72da9-9d45-46cb-8deb-8103dd88f562" label="ambiguous">10es</l><l xml:id="m-f8ce39fc-1267-4223-a128-3d3b87c4bb2e" facs="#m-95cbc598-ae6f-4b68-a09b-4d63242307b6" label="text-like">21st Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-bda43d5c-0505-4594-864b-07595caee809" facs="#m-b153c47a-717f-428e-a8c8-da834671acc7" label="lyrics-like">et in saécu-lum tu es “Dé¬ us.</l><l xml:id="m-f1f9c4dc-b5d3-44c0-9f2a-b4901f577e83" facs="#m-0dc1b21f-db6f-4360-a2ae-799eada53348" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-598301c0-6934-46f3-8700-9be7ca94f280" facs="#m-56763d5d-e259-48d8-9e92-fe8af6538e24" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-6f266fe7-f3c6-4dd1-bc52-ee3b65c10eb3" facs="#m-1803470b-5377-4393-95b2-b21567f46808" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia." ij.</l><l xml:id="m-1fbbdd0e-ec99-4767-b8ec-4bb20595fcbd" facs="#m-fc2d3784-9995-4364-96fe-8322b18655b1" label="ambiguous">L-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-dadc5fcb-0f91-42c0-b33c-cb2c2a6ba4b5" facs="#m-2738b909-f00c-46be-b623-4b60c69ad2e7" label="lyrics-like">V. In éx-i-tu Is-ra¬</l><l xml:id="m-9e00ca75-5ac7-4b4a-b40a-920185c79399" facs="#m-5ad6a85e-56c5-4d5b-a592-e76233a601f1" label="ambiguous">el ex</l><l xml:id="m-525ead95-6073-4531-8e35-ce5e1f644e58" facs="#m-cb985f00-3059-4199-8662-fc5e48c29b86" label="lyrics-like">dómus Já¬ cob de pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-82eb26a4-14b2-4716-9e75-a612e8ab92ea" facs="#m-24db3770-b8b6-448d-b2cd-676e11c3ea1c" label="ambiguous">Aegypto,</l><l xml:id="m-d76ec75d-f990-4780-9085-8f95b65fd7f2" facs="#m-85be8214-9136-4252-91c0-d5dde51e7fab" label="lyrics-like">pu-lo“bárbaro.</l><l xml:id="m-58845b2f-bdcb-4cee-8608-a8cef43b0bbd" facs="#m-dedbda66-995c-41c6-ac92-5d4bd494577e" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum. Matth. 18.c.</l><l xml:id="m-fae809bc-f55a-4d43-905f-2cf30a4d2771" facs="#m-c659bdc6-27cd-4219-b739-c2ca17f6225e" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Dixit Jesus di-[rogábat eum, dicens: Patiéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-cf3ae2d8-15d5-465e-8ae4-49eedaa255ed" facs="#m-fb279dc0-a5fb-4941-b4a5-0f88df3bd1b0" label="lyrics-like">L scipulis suis parábolam hanc:</l><l xml:id="m-7a3a2283-0b89-4458-b162-25204a0b5420" facs="#m-4474c6ca-d920-4020-b1a8-8da02b9d2282" label="lyrics-like">habe in me, et ómnia reddam tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-eea406c3-76b0-41e1-95ae-6f3fe3bcab31" facs="#m-7bb74572-938c-478f-b010-020228552a5b" label="lyrics-like">Assimilátum est regnum caelórum! Ille autem nóluit: sed ábiit, et mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c071c61a-93ec-4519-86c1-6671b895d634" facs="#m-2f8ebfaa-22e1-4edf-af11-81f6449bd645" label="lyrics-like">hómini regi, qui vóluit ratiónem</l><l xml:id="m-b6321a3e-e4ea-4993-92e7-bf68849b7494" facs="#m-f7e6d3b7-b282-4b50-9cff-2a2160124817" label="lyrics-like">sit eum in cárcerem, donec rédderet</l><l xml:id="m-d703ba3b-3f7d-44ad-8b91-ca250543adf8" facs="#m-b46ba98c-f7e0-44d1-8c1d-5040d2125874" label="lyrics-like">débitum. Vidéntes autem consérvi</l><l xml:id="m-ce6e8180-4cdf-4454-9093-dce16876244e" facs="#m-b99ba47a-fd8d-4cc0-93a7-ca030cc28024" label="lyrics-like">pónere cum servis suis. Et cum coe¬</l><l xml:id="m-287c28e8-0a86-485d-aafb-1bdd86cf7623" facs="#m-0bd1fb87-9f7f-4999-ae4f-e695d88b1c9a" label="lyrics-like">pisset ratiónem pónere, oblátus est ejus quae fiébant, contristáti sunt</l><l xml:id="m-cf928469-c208-4230-9edc-779d877166b4" facs="#m-c41fea30-b735-4c07-ad9d-dccffb81dca7" label="lyrics-like">ei unus, qui debébat ei decem millia</l><l xml:id="m-a6dc7137-f675-49a3-9ca4-2c153b632506" facs="#m-a48af629-d099-4c59-8d75-1869e2d3233c" label="lyrics-like">valde: et venérunt, et narravérunt</l><l xml:id="m-98053a6c-2a2a-4452-9ada-fc33c2b7eeeb" facs="#m-4375de64-03b7-4e1d-99f6-2d87462dc7d6" label="lyrics-like">talénta. Cum autem non habéret dómino suo ómnia, quae facta fúe¬</l><l xml:id="m-f14c9dd9-297b-40e6-b8df-c06b4f97b3cb" facs="#m-a7c1bdea-55cf-4b42-b28a-71070f7e16a1" label="lyrics-like">unde rédderet, jussit eum dóminus l rant. Tunc vocávit illum dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-221a8fb1-3a94-4add-b465-06483c94b87b" facs="#m-9e2b1fc6-430d-40a1-ae9d-3bcba0fd335a" label="lyrics-like">ejus venúmdari, et uxórem ejus, et</l><l xml:id="m-9469430a-b69b-45e2-add1-52821d80cfb3" facs="#m-4f84f569-631d-4253-8567-18ae6fe00b0c" label="ambiguous">suus, et ait illi : Serve nequam,</l><l xml:id="m-67a08709-7f84-4324-8848-2fc4ea27c2e3" facs="#m-310044a5-f0de-433e-ad7b-eebaa815160a" label="lyrics-like">fllios, et ómnia quae habébat, et omne débitum dimísi tibi, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-427172da-03f6-4d2d-95b8-8ddd37d826e2" facs="#m-4b5d2c16-c31c-4deb-a5f3-f24ff5e1f74f" label="lyrics-like">rogásti me: nonne ergo opórtuit et</l><l xml:id="m-b03c4481-9cc7-49f5-9fdd-a3eb6e335606" facs="#m-9fc12edf-c659-44a6-8278-f6118005c4a5" label="lyrics-like">reddi. Prócidens autem servus ille,</l><l xml:id="m-a70365e8-eab1-4a93-8a3d-090e5d4f2def" facs="#m-60422898-0ade-4c30-804d-c2fe1ba59eab" label="lyrics-like">orábat eum, dicens: Patiéntiam</l><l xml:id="m-57747864-c3ed-4082-ac6b-baf4e6cfda3d" facs="#m-b52a7a49-8aac-4d21-9361-127fe781eae7" label="lyrics-like">te miseréri consérvi tui, sicut et</l><l xml:id="m-96684d4a-bc7b-484d-8a0e-2f08976d8100" facs="#m-2553ba48-885b-4812-b5b1-e50958a2efa5" label="lyrics-like">ego tui misértus sum? Et irátus dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-722795b5-fa71-4fdd-a1ca-7b1cdba742e4" facs="#m-d1987f71-b111-4b45-bdd0-974cc642440b" label="lyrics-like">habe in me, et ómnia reddam tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-990f437b-5086-4a39-8e5c-b73cb88deec5" facs="#m-8df412ea-df97-49c9-ba12-5ed52771325e" label="lyrics-like">minus ejus, trádidit eum tortóribus,</l><l xml:id="m-ec9b8924-4aa2-41ed-a74a-a05f2f122b95" facs="#m-d02e0f43-2ba2-4057-a9dd-14372932c5ca" label="lyrics-like">Misértus autem dóminus servi illius,</l><l xml:id="m-efb1ca42-f757-497f-975a-98a283d0d13f" facs="#m-e9cfadb6-f14d-4a53-8036-c1102d38a325" label="lyrics-like">dimísit eum, et débitum dimisit ei.</l><l xml:id="m-ff048efc-8387-4c38-a633-d4ffb352f038" facs="#m-85caeaf8-4e98-4707-ae25-84fffbfa2653" label="lyrics-like">quoadúsque rédderet univérsum dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bbcd5c3-d4a8-4254-8d76-e5bf696c2ef4" facs="#m-a699c64c-82f9-4d44-bdd4-d2a065d2249e" label="lyrics-like">Egréssus autem servus ille, invénit bitum. Sic et Pater meus caeléstis</l><l xml:id="m-19065655-fe0a-47d7-8b64-84b5a1a503c9" facs="#m-592b7900-9810-4360-9993-b8ad4a41f0df" label="lyrics-like">unum de consérvis suis, qui debébat</l><l xml:id="m-ad7e2e0c-eacb-4601-802b-17e7de2f54af" facs="#m-1a10e975-7d5f-4d8d-9a2e-9928560965ef" label="lyrics-like">fáciet vobis, si non remiséritis unus¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8ca4518-c7b1-4fb9-94d1-72deb9799d90" facs="#m-fd744d3b-a81e-4e5d-a7eb-5856d42ed63c" label="lyrics-like">ei centum denários: et tenens suf¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0b9076b-c647-4cdf-aa5a-d24f72ad3545" facs="#m-d76c6766-b4b4-4328-9c6d-14e955551433" label="lyrics-like">quisque fratri suo de córdibus ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-acb08617-a2d1-4191-a783-5d193b999dad" facs="#m-ae864d2f-65a7-4eab-b1fd-1c0ddbe90ab4" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-0e2822e3-dc4d-4a91-9214-b65c649e4c4b" facs="#m-d96d9b9d-0a91-4214-a13c-6df2f9191dc4" label="lyrics-like">focábat eum, dicens: Redde quod stris.</l><l xml:id="m-73706536-7a4f-41cf-8eba-99172b59b12d" facs="#m-7764a33a-8103-4ac8-ad19-e25678a4feb4" label="lyrics-like">debes. Et prócidens consérvus ejus,</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>